{"steam_appid":1969860,"steam_name":"MACHI KORO With Everyone","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1969860/1962566195/0114bfaa5d75ac3c1ab498714a780e451ffc7f48/1751062574/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748955939","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257150179/59722ea94f25abb68fd8c05a58825b943c96f0be/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748955939","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969860/ss_e466dfc0b1690d0c33db6f92e276e688a7df93ca.1920x1080.jpg?t=1752570990","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969860/ss_4aee3a4f1efce98b50b957910d720c84ee0efc49.1920x1080.jpg?t=1752570990","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969860/ss_13d839efac6216de9dc632396233cd7d4e979c6a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1752570990","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969860/ss_2b47dbaeedee886b3699849ece7753c54f42e4b1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1752570990","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969860/ss_a58990b5d5dcbeb91a0aff551ebeabf3f8bf969a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1752570990"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969860/extras/47fbf22e1b5454d2ed828006f13f7998.avif?t=1752570990\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>🎲A colorful cast of characters are waiting for you in MACHI KORO With Everyone!  </strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With Remote Play Together support, players who own a copy can invite up to THREE friends to join in on all the fun! Roll the dice, get money, buy buildings and win!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>🎲What exactly is MACHI KORO With Everyone? </strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's the video game bundle that combines the classic board game Machi Koro, which has sold over a million copies worldwide, along with its sister game Machi Koro 2. Play offline, online with up to 4 players total. Family, friends and players around the world...everyone can join your game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>* &quot;Harbor&quot; and &quot;Millionaire's Row&quot; are not included</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>🎲Introduction to the Simple Rules of Machi Koro</strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969860/extras/24438950cc51e74779fdf98c91849a1c.avif?t=1752570990\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969860/extras_big/24438950cc51e74779fdf98c91849a1c.avif?t=1752570990 width=800 height=283 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969860/extras/2249293ff4c3e72e9edcac643ee15671.avif?t=1752570990\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969860/extras_big/2249293ff4c3e72e9edcac643ee15671.avif?t=1752570990 width=800 height=665 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969860/extras/06a2894c0a683f12b6178908ffdaf279.avif?t=1752570990\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969860/extras_big/06a2894c0a683f12b6178908ffdaf279.avif?t=1752570990 width=800 height=382 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>🎲Various Ways to Play! Single &amp; Multiplayer</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play with up to 4 people, both online and offline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969860/extras/6a8d942b19263f3e9fbd4fbb5f258db3.avif?t=1752570990\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Friends -You can invite friends from Steam to play. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Guests - You can play exclusively with people who know the password you share via social media or other means. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random Match - You can play with players from around the world matched randomly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>* Each player needs their own hardware and software, unless the host invites a guest using Remote Play Together.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>* Cross-platform play is not supported.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offline</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play against the CPU by yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 to 4 players can play in local multiplayer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*　Play while taking turns with multiple other players.</i></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7300U<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel(R) HD Graphics 620<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Strategy"],"developers":["Grounding Inc."],"publishers":["Grounding Inc."],"release_date":"4 Jul, 2024"}